[5.225945, "o", "  \u001b[2mstep            op                       ms   conf  artifact\u001b[0m\r\n  candidates      filesys_glob            2.3\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpath_list[3] e.g. server-out.log\u001b[0m\r\n  picked_file     decide_pick             9.3\u001b[32m   0.93\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpicked_items[1] e.g. notes.md\u001b[0m\r\n  content         filesys_read            0.1\u001b[32m   1.00\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mfile_content :: # Project notes Th\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  status \u001b[32mdone\u001b[0m   confidence 0.93   \u001b[1m3\u001b[0m hops in 22 ms wall\r\n"]
